# hsk vscode check

After completing VS Code extension (`vscode/`) code changes, before each `hsk vscode check` run `hsk vscode format` first.

Run `hsk vscode format`, then `hsk vscode check`, and fix until it passes.
Repeat this cycle up to **3 times maximum**. If it still fails after 3 iterations, stop and report the remaining errors.

Do not finish while `hsk vscode check` still fails, unless the failure is environmental (missing Node.js/npm) and cannot be fixed in code.

Equivalent npm from `vscode/harrix-notes-explorer-hsk/`:

- format: `npm run format` (`biome check --write .`)
- check: `npm run check` (`biome check .`)
